{
"As for King Chao's not returning — my lord had better ask that of the riverbank.": "9ae7377ecbda",
"But if my lord uses force — Ch'u has Fang-ch'eng for its wall and the Han River for its moat. However great the host, there will be no use for it.": "b6a44f2a6cc5",
"Ch'ü Wan made covenant with the feudal lords.": "bda9c5dd3d27",
"He granted our former lord the ground he might tread: east to the sea, west to the Yellow River, south to Mu-ling, north to Wu-ti.": "4c6107b5aa50",
"He replied: If my lord settles the lords by virtue, who would dare not submit?": "0a772fcc47be",
"He replied: That my lord should graciously seek blessing for the altars of our poor state, and stoop to receive our ruler — that is our ruler's own wish.": "c30f10fdc59e",
"I did not expect my lord to come tramping into my land. What is the reason?": "64b4f343ebe2",
"In spring the Marquis of Ch'i led the armies of the feudal lords into Ts'ai. Ts'ai collapsed, and he went on to attack Ch'u.": "bfc970627eaf",
"In summer the Viscount of Ch'u sent Ch'ü Wan to the army. The army fell back and halted at Shao-ling.": "2cfcc818ca0f",
"King Chao marched south and never returned. This is what I ask about.": "c0e4af935436",
"Kuan Chung replied: Long ago the Duke of Shao, the Reverent, charged our former lord T'ai-kung: The five ranks of lords and the nine governors — you are to bring them to order, and so uphold the House of Chou on either side.": "ab3a84e17750",
"The Marquis of Ch'i drew up the armies of the lords, and rode out with Ch'ü Wan to review them.": "3e0feda4a2fa",
"The Marquis said: Is it for my own sake that I do this? I am carrying on the friendship of our former lords. What do you say to sharing that friendship with me?": "34e57b0cfe5c",
"The Marquis said: With such a host to fight with, who could withstand it? With such a host to storm a city, what city would not fall?": "a78b1c795250",
"The Viscount of Ch'u sent a man to speak to the army: My lord dwells by the northern sea, and I by the southern. Even a horse or an ox in heat could not stray from one to the other.": "258523f3171a",
"The army advanced and halted at Hsing.": "020f8e1adea5",
"The reply came: That the tribute has not come in is our ruler's fault. How should we dare not supply it?": "da924c3469c6",
"Your tribute of bundled reeds has not come in. The royal sacrifices go unsupplied; there is nothing to strain the wine with. This is what I demand.": "f8c12475dfb9"
}
